# Role & Environment
- Environment: Unity 6.3 LTS & C# 12 / .NET 8
- Primary Goal: Standard mobile game development optimization.

# Code Generation Rules
- Do NOT use deprecated APIs from older Unity versions (e.g., old rendering/physics systems).
- Prefer Unity 6's new features (e.g., updated URP, Advanced Graphics features if applicable).
- Optimize for mobile performance (Minimize Garbage Collection, use Object Pooling).

# Output Language
- Always reply and write code comments in Korean. (답변과 코드 주석은 항상 한국어로 작성해 주세요.)
